{'symbol': 'PFG', 'date': '2022-09-22 12:40:00', 'title': 'PRINCIPAL® SMALL BUSINESS EVENT HIGHLIGHTS IMPORTANCE OF LEVERAGING TECHNOLOGY FOR BUSINESS GROWTH', 'text': "DES MOINES, IOWA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PRINCIPAL FINANCIAL GROUP® AND THE SMALL BUSINESS DIGITAL ALLIANCE (SBDA) ARE HOSTING A CONVERSATION WITH SMALL BUSINESS LEADERS TO EXPLORE THE CONNECTION BETWEEN A SUSTAINABLE BUSINESS MODEL AND THE IMPLEMENTATION OF DIGITAL TOOLS. THE PANEL, TAKING PLACE ON NATIONAL AMERICAN BUSINESS WOMEN'S DAY, WILL INCLUDE KEY NATIONAL AND LOCAL FEMALE LEADERS INCLUDING ISABELLA CASILLAS GUZMAN, 27TH ADMINISTRATOR OF THE U.S. SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION, MARIANNE MARKOW"}